WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.032
Bird and Kip walked around the park.

2
00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:22.048
They were looking for a new tree.

3
00:00:22.049 --> 00:00:26.993
"I need a strong branch for my nest," said Bird.

4
00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:34.530
"I need a good hole for my acorns," said Kip.

5
00:00:34.531 --> 00:00:37.760
"There's a maple tree," said Bird.

6
00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:43.345
"It looks very strong."

7
00:00:43.346 --> 00:00:48.598
The two friends went up the maple tree.

8
00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:51.863
"These branches are strong," said Bird.

9
00:00:51.864 --> 00:00:54.629
"I can build a nest here."

10
00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:57.471
Kip rubbed his chin.

11
00:00:57.472 --> 00:01:01.740
"I don't see any holes," he said.

12
00:01:01.741 --> 00:01:06.228
"I can't live in this tree."

13
00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:09.942
Kip pointed to an old tree.

14
00:01:09.943 --> 00:01:14.291
"Let's try that tree," said Kip.

15
00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:19.933
"It has lots of holes."

16
00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:24.100
The two friends went to the old tree.

17
00:01:24.101 --> 00:01:27.988
Kip climbed into a hole.

18
00:01:27.989 --> 00:01:31.492
"This tree is perfect!" said Kip.

19
00:01:31.493 --> 00:01:38.649
Bird scratched her head.

20
00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:41.814
"These branches are too thin," she said.

21
00:01:41.815 --> 00:01:46.291
"I can't live in this tree."

